    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LVI} Gif ðeof sie gefongen, swelte he deaðe, oððe his lif be his were man aliese.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a thief is caught, let him suffer death, or his life can be redeemed by [payment of] his wergild.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a thief is taken he shall die the death, or his life shall be redeemed by the payment of his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif þeof sy gefongen, swylte he deaðe, oþþe his lif be his were man alyse.</ab>
      </div>
